{"updated":"2026-09-11T09:15:29.505Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Five dead and dozens injured in coach crash in Swiss Alps. Elsewhere, world Athletics Ultimate Championship opens with record $10m prize pot. And pro-Palestine student suspended by King’s College London returns to campus. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 2.1 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.5 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 2.0 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 26 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.4 near southern East Pacific Rise. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.15,0.2,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.34,0.37,0.42,0.46,0.49,0.51,0.55,0.57,0.61,0.73,0.82,0.97,1.3,1.42,1.47,1.5,1.52,1.57,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.72,1.79,1.85,1.89,1.93,1.96,2.01,2.04,2.08,2.13,2.17,2.22,2.25,2.3,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.47,2.52,2.58,2.63,2.75,2.87,3.02,3.04,3.08,3.11,3.16,3.2,3.26,3.38,3.46,3.52,3.59,3.63,3.68,3.73,3.76,3.81,3.83,3.85,3.9,3.92,3.95,3.97,4.02,4.06,4.14,4.2,4.27,4.34,4.4,4.46,4.49,4.55,4.57,4.63,4.75,4.9,5.07,5.58,5.67,5.82,5.88,5.92,5.97,6.01,6.11,6.17,6.21,6.26,6.29,6.32,6.35,6.42,6.47,6.56,6.62,6.69,6.73,6.79,6.87,6.92,7.01,7.08,7.12,7.15,7.2,7.22,7.26,7.29,7.33,7.42,7.46,7.55,7.59,7.64,7.67,7.72,7.75,7.83,7.91,7.96,8.02,8.08,8.13,8.17,8.24,8.3,8.36,8.42,8.46,8.51,8.59,8.71,8.78,8.86,8.97,9.09,9.47,9.59,9.65,9.71,9.75,9.8,9.85,9.89,9.95,10.08,10.11,10.32,10.38,10.46,10.52,10.6,10.65,10.71,10.74,10.8,10.84,10.9,10.97,11.04,11.11,11.18,11.23,11.3,11.37,11.41,11.47,11.52,11.56,11.61,11.64,11.67,11.7,11.74,11.79,11.83,11.89,11.95,12.02,12.06,12.12,12.18,12.23,12.28,12.37,12.61,12.76,12.83,12.89,12.93,12.98,13.03,13.05,13.09,13.12,13.15,13.